@startuml
' Figure 22.4  Writing a memory with provenance
' Reading order: top to bottom. The loop proposes a draft with its
' source event; the store takes the tenant from the token, checks the
' draft, compares the head, then writes the record and the trail line.
' A draft with no source is refused. From memory.store.write.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
participant "Loop" as L <<knowledge>>
participant "Store" as S <<knowledge>>
participant "Trail" as T <<evidence>>
L -> S : Draft with source
S -> S : Tenant, checks, head
S -> T : Written
S --> L : Record
L -> S : Draft, no source
S -[$FAIL]> T : Refused
@enduml
